-           Each case has a stable number:
+           У каждого кейса стабильный номер:

-           ```tabular
+           ```tabular

-           column  Case
-           column  Code
-           column  Message
-           column  Note
-           row  `DuplicateEntry(path)`  1  _the path `path` is a duplicate entry_  refused before any byte is serialized
+           column  Кейс
+           column  Код
+           column  Сообщение
+           column  Примечание
+           row  `DuplicateEntry(path)`  1  _the path `path` is a duplicate entry_  отвергается до сериализации первого байта

-           row  `NotFound(path)`  2  _path `path` was not found in the ZIP file_
+           row  `NotFound(path)`  2  _path `path` was not found in the ZIP file_

-           row  `InvalidName(name)`  3  _the name `name` is not valid for a ZIP entry_  not a valid `Path on Zip`
-           row  `UnsupportedMethod(method)`  4  _the compression method `method` is not supported_  anything but stored or deflate
-           row  `MissingEocd`  5  _no end-of-central-directory record could be found_  so the bytes are not a ZIP archive
+           row  `InvalidName(name)`  3  _the name `name` is not valid for a ZIP entry_  недопустимый `Path on Zip`
+           row  `UnsupportedMethod(method)`  4  _the compression method `method` is not supported_  что угодно, кроме stored или deflate
+           row  `MissingEocd`  5  _no end-of-central-directory record could be found_  значит, байты не являются ZIP-архивом

-           row  `TruncatedArchive`  6  _the ZIP archive ended unexpectedly_
+           row  `TruncatedArchive`  6  _the ZIP archive ended unexpectedly_

